// Nethersea Spewer (enemy_1233_dsshtr) and Nourished Spewer (_2); Nethersea Predator (enemy_1231_dsrunr) and Nourished
// Predator (_2). Nethersea Brand is the creep the game marks with buff_creep[tile]: here, standing on a tile_creep or
// tile_creepf tile.
// - EpDamage (both): trap_creep_ep_damage on every damage the unit outputs creates trap_creep_apply_ep_damage on the
//   target: ApplyElementDamage SANITY (Nervous Impairment) of EpDamage.ep_damage_ratio x ATK.
// - Spewer Attack: one selector takes units within its 1.0 collider OR carrying buff_creep[tile] anywhere, up to
//   Attack.attack@max_target (3); the speed-10 projectile_enemy_dsshtr (lifetime 5) deals ATK Physical.
// - Predator BlockFree: every 0.2 s, on Brand it derives dsrunr_blockfree (BLOCK_FREE), off Brand it ends it.
// - Predator Evade: Physical and Arts dodge of Evade.prob, disabled by STUNNED, FROZEN, SILENCED, LEVITATE, UNMOVABLE,
//   STUNNED_NO_AMPLIFY_DAMAGE or SLEEPING (flags 0, 16, 12, 25, 13, 19; combo 0 in the pinned enum dump).
// Every component reachable from the retained abilities, the templates and the projectile are pinned below with local
// references reduced to null/local; the variants differ only in their skeleton.
